<BaseLayout title="About Us — TaxCalc UK">
  <h1>About TaxCalc UK</h1>
  <p>TaxCalc UK is a free, independent tool built to help people in the UK quickly estimate their Income Tax, National Insurance, and take-home pay based on their annual salary.</p>
  <p>We built this tool because most tax calculators are cluttered, slow, or hide results behind ads and sign-ups. Ours is instant, free, and works on any device.</p>
  <p>All calculations are based on the latest published HMRC tax bands and National Insurance thresholds, updated each tax year.</p>
  <p class="text-muted small">This site is run independently and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to HMRC or any UK government body.</p>
</BaseLayout>
